; The bridge's exports, with the ordinals of Pioneer's onnxruntime.dll for rekordbox 7 on Windows
; (ONNX Runtime 1.18.0, DirectML build). rekordbox.exe and Demucs3.dll import @1 and @4 BY ORDINAL,
; so these numbers are a contract: never renumber them. rbstems_marker comes after, so that the app
; can tell the bridge from Pioneer's library (it also looks for the "rbstems bridge: " string).
LIBRARY onnxruntime.dll
EXPORTS
    OrtGetApiBase                                   @1
    OrtSessionOptionsAppendExecutionProviderEx_DML  @2
    OrtSessionOptionsAppendExecutionProvider_CPU    @3
    OrtSessionOptionsAppendExecutionProvider_DML    @4
    rbstems_marker                                  @5 DATA
